				<horizpar>Locations were derived from maps varying from 1:2,000,000-scale to 1:5,000-scale. The positional accuracy of each site was checked against mineral occurrence maps and figures from reports and, for some developed sites, were compared against mines visible on satellite imagery available online at Google Earth.</horizpar>
